      "text": "We are in an era of flux & fighting over how AI should be used to review academic work & by whom.\n\nBut it is worth proving to yourself that yes, AI used properly can be very insightful at this, by asking GPT-6 Pro/Opus 5.5 High to give helpful, substantive feedback on one of your papers.",
